artefact/
/MF_Logics/Mututal_Funds_data_extraction/NAV_level_data
MF_Logics/MF_fund_view_data/MF_evaluation framework.xlsx
MF_Logics/Mututal_Funds_data_extraction/mf_nav_history.txt
AI_Agents/Reference_docs/Prozpr_fund_ranking.csv
/notebooks

# Local worktrees
.claude/worktrees/relaxed-hermann-5c135c/
.claude/worktrees/quirky-bhabha-632a4b/

# User-filed issue reports (Excel register + screenshots) — runtime artifacts
issue_reports/

# Legacy SQLite dev database + its restore sidecars. Untracked 2026-08-25: these
# were committed and contain real user rows (a team member's PAN and mobile),
# which `*.db` above never caught because they were already in the index.
# Untracking stops further distribution; it does NOT remove them from history —
# that needs a filter-repo/BFG rewrite plus a force-push. See the DPDP report.
/wealth_agent.db
/wealth_agent.db.bak-*
/wealth_agent.db.before-restore-*

# VR smoke-test output (contains vendor table names + row counts, not secrets)
vr_smoke_report.json
